1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
这盘"新疆名菜"，其实才40岁
This "Xinjiang classic" is only 40.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,900
发明它的，是个四川厨师
Its inventor was a Sichuan cook.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
1987年，312国道边的小店
1987, a shack on Highway 312.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,900
本是给卡车司机的实惠菜
A cheap, filling dish for truckers.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
大托盘一端，"来盘大盘鸡"
On a huge tray — "big-plate chicken."

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,900
鸡、土豆、辣子，铺满一盘
Chicken, potato, chili — a full plate.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
汤汁浓，越炖越入味
Rich sauce, deeper with every stew.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,900
吃到底，再下一把皮带面
At the bottom: in go the belt noodles.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
一只鸡，两种吃法
One chicken, two ways to eat.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,400
40岁的"新疆味"，你吃过吗？
A 40-year-old classic — tried it?
